      "tutoring": "Generally useful, but the catalyst explanation conflates the ratio of actual forward/reverse reaction rates with the equilibrium constant. Actual rates are equal at equilibrium; rate constants and concentration ratios must be distinguished. It also uses LaTeX parenthesis/bracket delimiters despite the existing dollar-delimiter instruction."
    },
